Readings to state plainly:
- **Spine / extremity:** T1.4 vs T1.3 is in-distribution supervised gain. Say so; it is not
  portability.
- **Ribs / abdomen:** neither adapter trained on them, so T1.4 > T1.3 there is the cross-anatomy
  transfer signal. Note the open alternative (format familiarity with non-chest study-type strings)
